    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax, explore, and restore.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a calming adventure to restore Earth\u2019s most iconic environments and bring them back to life \u2014 one mission at a time.</strong><br><br><br><br>From pristine beaches to arid deserts and soaring mountain vistas, explore and heal a world overwhelmed by pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends to clean, relax, and reconnect with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to intuitive and satisfying gameplay, every action brings visible change \u2014 and deep gratification.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/0351699f3abe14618c8bb399b1540a34.poster.avif?t=1752835650\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/0351699f3abe14618c8bb399b1540a34.webm?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/0351699f3abe14618c8bb399b1540a34.mp4?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>A Futuristic Cleaning Tool: The Terra Cleaner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the quiet thrill of restoration as your modular vacuum hums to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your Terra Cleaner, collect scattered litter, uncover buried debris, and deal with toxic waste hidden beneath the surface.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new modules and upgrades to adapt your tools to increasingly complex cleanup missions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/dbb6712291a46bedc860805f982ff2ff.avif?t=1752835650\" width=800 height=393 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think and Adapt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Every environment is a unique puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels and diverse debris types challenge your observation and strategy \u2014 from dense clutter in tight alleys to hazardous zones in rocky cliffs. Adapt your tools and approach with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/25209c772328a7f9c72307683a951be0.avif?t=1752835650\" width=800 height=511 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play your way:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Relax and clean at your own pace, join up with up to <strong>3 friends for cooperative missions</strong>, or jump into <strong>large-group co-op maps</strong> with 10+ players in live multiplayer zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, restore nature\u2019s beauty through online collaborative missions. And you're also stronger together! The closer you are with other players, the more effective your Terra Cleaner becomes! Invite your friends or join them to enhance your cleaning while having more fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/39b5ddce09d0951cb212626e11ad9347.poster.avif?t=1752835650\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/39b5ddce09d0951cb212626e11ad9347.webm?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/39b5ddce09d0951cb212626e11ad9347.mp4?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>A Meaningful Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just cleaning \u2014 it's a small step toward something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect on the impact of individual action, restore ecosystems, and contribute to a hopeful message about healing our world together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/6be00e9638e1e2083fb566e7b4999214.avif?t=1752835650\" width=680 height=409 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax, explore, and restore.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a calming adventure to restore Earth\u2019s most iconic environments and bring them back to life \u2014 one mission at a time.</strong><br><br><br><br>From pristine beaches to arid deserts and soaring mountain vistas, explore and heal a world overwhelmed by pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends to clean, relax, and reconnect with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to intuitive and satisfying gameplay, every action brings visible change \u2014 and deep gratification.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/0351699f3abe14618c8bb399b1540a34.poster.avif?t=1752835650\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/0351699f3abe14618c8bb399b1540a34.webm?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/0351699f3abe14618c8bb399b1540a34.mp4?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>A Futuristic Cleaning Tool: The Terra Cleaner</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the quiet thrill of restoration as your modular vacuum hums to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your Terra Cleaner, collect scattered litter, uncover buried debris, and deal with toxic waste hidden beneath the surface.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new modules and upgrades to adapt your tools to increasingly complex cleanup missions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/dbb6712291a46bedc860805f982ff2ff.avif?t=1752835650\" width=800 height=393 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think and Adapt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Every environment is a unique puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels and diverse debris types challenge your observation and strategy \u2014 from dense clutter in tight alleys to hazardous zones in rocky cliffs. Adapt your tools and approach with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/25209c772328a7f9c72307683a951be0.avif?t=1752835650\" width=800 height=511 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play your way:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Relax and clean at your own pace, join up with up to <strong>3 friends for cooperative missions</strong>, or jump into <strong>large-group co-op maps</strong> with 10+ players in live multiplayer zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, restore nature\u2019s beauty through online collaborative missions. And you're also stronger together! The closer you are with other players, the more effective your Terra Cleaner becomes! Invite your friends or join them to enhance your cleaning while having more fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/39b5ddce09d0951cb212626e11ad9347.poster.avif?t=1752835650\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/39b5ddce09d0951cb212626e11ad9347.webm?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/39b5ddce09d0951cb212626e11ad9347.mp4?t=1752835650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>A Meaningful Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just cleaning \u2014 it's a small step toward something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect on the impact of individual action, restore ecosystems, and contribute to a hopeful message about healing our world together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402720/extras/6be00e9638e1e2083fb566e7b4999214.avif?t=1752835650\" width=680 height=409 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a serene journey to breathtaking locations tarnished by pollution. With your high-tech vacuum cleaner, restore nature's beauty by clearing trash. Play solo or team up with friends to relax, explore, and make a meaningful impact in this calming game that turns cleanup into an adventure.",
